# Declaration only (spec 21 section 6, spec 25): games.guess keeps its own patterns and operations. This schema serves the dice, the example chips and the action buttons (std.sample):
# the whole sentences the dice may say are read from the world's own state by the hook `sampleKnowledge` of ops.mjs (declaredExecutor). Nothing is generated except schema.declared.mjs.
@guess acts.schema
    noun="answer"
    declare=yes
    doc="Guess the animal: the answers to the question that is asked, or the start."
    acts=make

@guess.answer acts.kind
    know=answers:*
    dice.not=make
    plural=answers
